<title>INDIA: India Maha Scooters buys 5 pct of Bajaj Auto Fin.</title>
<headline>India Maha Scooters buys 5 pct of Bajaj Auto Fin.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Bajaj Auto Finance Ltd said on Wednesday that Maharashtra Scooters Ltd has acquired more than five percent of its stock.</p>
<p>&quot;The number of equity shares acquired together with equity shares already held by Maharashtra Scooters Ltd exceed 5 percent of the paid up share capital of this company,&quot; Bajaj Auto Finance said in statement to the Bombay Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>It did not give any details.</p>
<p>Both the companies are part of scooter giant Bajaj Auto group.</p>
<p>--Bombay equities desk +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
